{%- capture subject -%}Your subscription ended{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture html -%}
<p>Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>Your {{ merchant.name }} subscription ({{ subscription.plan }}) ended on {{ subscription.ended_at }}.{% case subscription.reason %}{% when "payment_failed" %} It ended because its payment could not be collected.{% when "trial_without_payment_method" %} It ended because your trial ended without a payment method.{% when "requested_by_customer" %} It ended as you asked.{% endcase %}</p>
<p>You will not be charged for it any more.</p>
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">You receive this email because of your subscription with {{ merchant.name }}.</p>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture text -%}
